+        # the `| tee ...; grep -q` shape.
+        #
+        # NO NETWORK IS ASSUMED. `just fetch-chronos-tiny` downloads only files that
+        # are ABSENT and hashes unconditionally (REVIEW-06-03, verify-always), so with
+        # the weights mounted it performs integrity checks and nothing else. That is
+        # deliberate: a cached or pre-mounted weights directory crossing a trust
+        # boundary is exactly what an unconditional re-hash is for.
+        #
+        # TWO RUNNER PREREQUISITES, both for the human to confirm before this merges:
